      "message": "More explaination. The `battery_state_of_charge_abs(\u0026soc) !\u003d EC_SUCCESS` is a superset of `battery_get_disconnect_state()`. The `board_usb_pd_connect()` updated the timeout value to delay the 5V enabling.",
